// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Praetorians_Mission1.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1646000429" "As you are aware, {HeroName}, Portal Corporation has faced down some serious threats from the dimension they designate Upsilon Beta 9-6, otherwise known as Praetorian Earth. That dimension is a false utopia ruled by an overbearing version of our own Statesman, only there he is Emperor Marcus Cole. There is a group calling itself the Resistance who has offered us help in taking down these Praetorian supervillains. We've been given some of the weaknesses these Praetorians have, and I am about to send you on some of the most critical missions you will have carried out so far. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to battle this threat at the source: Praetoria.</A><br<br>The dangers you will face on that world will be monstrous, so I recommend always having some friends along as backup."
// AcceptString :
"P2825864701" "Battle the Praetorian threat"
// SendOffString :
"P303913661" "Your first task is to prevent their version of Infernal from summoning more demons to bind within his spectral armor. I need you to get to Infernal's lair in Praetoria and destroy his summoning altar."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P969353046" "Defeat Infernal & his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1084218960" "You've got to prevent Infernal from summoning more demons!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3514814799" "The shadows that flit across the cavern walls seem somehow substantial."
