"P2439939790" "Let the darkness rise and shroud the Earth!"
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3598524332" "You should know better than to disrupt such a ritual!"
// Script Variable VICTIM_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1241907964" "Sacrificial victim"
// Script Variable SACRIFICE_SACRIFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P51475904" "Your blood shall call forth unnamable legions!"
// Script Variable SACRIFICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P880197516" "I don't want to die!"
// Script Variable SACRIFICE_SACRIFICER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4028289060" "You will ruin everything!"
// Script Variable SACRIFICE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P3090495159" "Oh, thank you! Thank you!"
