// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3605815029" "I think they've sent me the right hero for this job, {HeroName}. In one mighty effort, you crippled the armies of Infernal, one of the biggest threats the Praetorians have to offer. I've got many more jobs like this for you, and not one of them is going to be easy. But I'm beginning to believe that you'll see them through to the finish."
// RandomFameString :
"P3849601593" "I hear {HeroName} stopped a massive demon summoning!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Praetorians_Mission2.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3376104315" "In Praetoria there is a ghost who goes by the name of Diabolique, and is their version of our very own Numina. We have learned that she has no free will of her own, and is completely controlled by Emperor Cole, bound by some mystic artifact. We do know that she roams around the Magisterium in Praetoria on a nightly basis, and that could be an excellent opportunity to launch a surprise attack. I am going to portal you directly into the heart of the beast, the Magisterium Plaza where <A HREF={ACCEPT}>you will have only 30 minutes to locate and defeat Diabolique.</A> Fail to do so and we will lose our chance to take her down for now. Are you up to the task?"
// AcceptString :
"P1218187676" "Stop Diabolique before she enslaves the spirits in the graveyard"
// SendOffString :
"P304650693" "It's hard to believe that Numina's alternate self can be so evil."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2661104499" "Defeat Diabolique"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3286994579" "If you don't hurry, Diabolique will bind those poor spirits to her forever!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2743267621" "You are going to need to move swiftly if you want to avoid the Praetorian Guard being summoned to bring you down."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3352535467" "Diabolique"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1084054697" "Come forth, and be my slaves!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2481664217" "You will not cheat me of my servants!"

