// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Praetorians_Mission3.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HolyWater 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3574653660" "Holy water"
// DetailString :
"P1670267083" "This flask of water has been blessed by Father Hanrahan, one of Paragon City's many priests. By sprinkling it over the bones of Shadowhunter's victims, you can weaken the villain's power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3202024049" "A while back we had intel on a Praetorian version of Woodsman called Shadowhunter. It seems that the Praetorian version's fate has caught up to that of his Primal counterpart and he's now dead. Killed by the Devouring Earth that rule the areas outside of Praetoria. Unfortunately this man killed tons of people and left thier bodies strewn throughout the forests, unconsecrated. Because of his nature, these bodies have the ability to ressurect him and he'll be a threat once again. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to go to Shadowhunter's former lair and consecrate the bodies strewn about there.</A> Doing this will keep him dead a little while longer.<br><br>Watch out for the Devouring Earth, they are just as viscious, if not moreso, in Praetoria."
// AcceptString :
"P4198205791" "Go to Shadowhunter's lair and consecrate the bones"
// SendOffString :
"P3045337781" "This may be a tactical strike, but it's also a mission of mercy. You'll be freeing many trapped and miserable spirits."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3967918098" "Prevent Shadowhunter's ressurection"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1730757971" "I need you to get to Shadowhunter's lair and consecrate those bones!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4131505992" "Shadowhunter dared to live out among the Devouring Earth. It was only a matter of time before he was caught and killed."
// Script Variable MISSION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2276792574" "Food for the earth mother!"
// Script Variable MISSION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P475477105" "Intruders!"
// Script Variable MISSION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2881817417" "So hungry!"

