"P3352291133" "You begin to sprinkle the holy water."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P2557807414" "You have been interrupted!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2776923146" "You have consecrated the bones."
// InteractActionString :
"P569040498" "Consecrating..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1560484918" "You freed a trapped spirit and weakened Shadowhunter!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P950223911" "Here's a bottle of holy water. Use it sparingly, {HeroName}; from what I understand, Shadowhunter has many victims."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2269308610" "You consecrated the bones of Shadowhunter's victims, preventing his ressurection."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3433604980" "Good work, {HeroName}. We need to do this occassionally to prevent Shadowhunter's ressurection. I will seek out a more permanent solution."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Praetorians_Mission4.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3351419878" "I heard you were responsible for taking down Marauder, Anti-Matter, and Neuron earlier this month. They got tossed in the Zig, but while they were setting up their 'special containment', they each broke out.<br><br>Neuron and Anti-Matter had the smarts to figure out how to portal back to Praetoria, but Marauder got left behind. I heard he gathered up the remnants of the invasion force he brough here and they are holed up in a warehouse. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>They are planning something big and I need you to go in and take him down.</A> You've done it once, I know you can do it again."
// AcceptString :
"P3853575603" "Wipe out Marauder's cell"
// SendOffString :
"P3640677892" "Marauder may have his metal mits on a portal back to Praetoria. If you find it, destroy it, it's better he's here where we can keep a closer eye on him."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3374950828" "Defeat Marauder and destroy the portal"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1062892147" "Marauder's recapture is your number one priority, {HeroName}."
// TaskTitle :
"P811573886" "The Marauder's Cell"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3373623222" "Scuff marks on the floor testify to lots of recent activity."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P551730851" "Marauder"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4004054243" "Man, I want to find {HeroName} and make them pay for what they did to me."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2507351669" "Oh, it's like Christmas morning! I know just what I want to rip open, too!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1228833033" "I ain't going down like last time!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1057170898" "Yeah, you're just makin' me mad!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P494098451" "Ok, kid gloves are off!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P127752908" "No, not again!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1677870158" "I ain't going back to jail!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2951667279" "<em victory>Yeah, that's what I thought. A chump."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"

