"P352188880" "The Domme sure throws a good party."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2833547727" "Ssh. Did you hear something?"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P800037776" "We will defend Dominatrix with our lives!"

